sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant D as DSH
  participant C as Cordis config
  participant P as Official package

  O->>D: remove replacement bundle and patch
  D->>C: patch removed
  O->>D: restart DSH by exact service or PID
  D->>C: load installed official entries
  D->>P: activate official provider and Models
  O->>D: dump-config
  D-->>O: official entries active, replacement absent
  O->>D: replay provider/model call and settings operation
  D-->>O: original behavior restored
